*HEADING
Three cantilevers (L = 100, E = 1e7) under uniform line loads (*DLOAD), which ccx has no
card for and the converter applies as consistent nodal forces. Beam theory, tip
deflection q L^4 / (8 E I):
  A: B31, RECT 2 x 4, n1 = z, global PY = -0.01 -> u_y = -0.0011719 (I = 2 * 4^3 / 12)
  B: B32, RECT 2 x 4, n1 = y, local P2 = 0.01 (local 2 = t x n1 = +z) -> u_z = +0.0011719
  C: B31, CIRC r = 1 (run as B32 with midside nodes), global PZ = -0.001 -> u_z = -0.0015915
